# Validator Integration
RULE: Add validators as Step 5 in quality-gates.sh. Blocking — failures fail quality gates and block merge.
WHY: Production readiness is non-negotiable; silent validator failures hide real architectural violations.
CODEX: validators/CI_CD_INTEGRATION_SUMMARY.md, .cursor/rules/production-readiness-validators.mdc
DO: Run run-all-validators.sh --category alignment; propagate exit code; fail fast on validator failure
NEVER: Suppress validator exit codes; ignore validator failures; skip validators in new services
